# <type>(<scope>)?: <subject>
#
# <type> is one of: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test,
#                   build, ci, chore, revert
#
# Subject rules:
# - imperative, present tense ("add", not "added" or "adds")
# - no capital first letter, no trailing period, 72 characters or fewer
# - do not repeat the project name in the subject
#
# Body (optional): explain what and why, wrapped at 72 columns.
# Breaking changes: use "feat!:" and a "BREAKING CHANGE:" footer.
#
# Examples:
# feat: add cross-agent session conversion library
# fix: report truncated OpenCode timestamps instead of failing
